# Simulation: Mix two solutions 1:1
# The mixed solution has 25 mmol/kg C and 25 mmol/kg Ca (after 1:1 mixing)
# But question says 50 mmol/kg each - perhaps they mean the mixed solution
# Let's try: mixed solution with 50 mmol/kg C AND 50 mmol/kg Ca
# Then heat from 20 to 200°C in 10 steps

SOLUTION 1
    temp      20
    pH        7
    units     mmol/kgw
    C(4)      50
    Ca        50

EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Calcite   0   0

REACTION_TEMPERATURE 1
    20  38  56  74  92  110  128  146  164  182  200

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file   calcite_mixing_heating4.sel
    -reset  false
    -temperature    true
    -equilibrium_phases  Calcite

END
